# Private client profiles and photography assets.
# Las clases de caracteres son deliberadas: las camaras escriben la extension en
# mayusculas (IMG_1347.JPG, DSC_0001.NEF) y en Linux o macOS `*.jpg` NO casa con
# `.JPG`, asi que una foto personal quedaria sin ignorar. Windows lo disimula por
# ser insensible a mayusculas, lo que hace el fallo dificil de ver desde aqui.
private/
client-profiles/
*.[cC][rR]2
*.[cC][rR]3
*.[nN][eE][fF]
*.[aA][rR][wW]
*.[dD][nN][gG]
*.[rR][aA][fF]
*.[oO][rR][fF]
*.[rR][wW]2
*.[hH][eE][iI][cC]
*.[tT][iI][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF][fF]
*.[pP][sS][dD]
*.[xX][cC][fF]

# Large media should not enter source control by default
*.[jJ][pP][gG]
*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
*.[pP][nN][gG]
*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]
*.[aA][vV][iI][fF]
# Las excepciones se mantienen en minusculas a proposito: es la direccion segura.
# Un asset legitimo llamado LOGO.PNG requerira `git add -f`, mientras que una foto
# personal en mayusculas seguira quedando fuera.
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/**/*.jpg
!assets/**/*.jpeg
!docs/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.jpg
!tests/fixtures/**/*.png
!tests/fixtures/**/*.jpg

# Internal working documents: audit/validation reports. They are not product
# documentation and must not travel inside a distribution artifact. Listed one by
# one on purpose: a wildcard here could silently hide legitimate documentation.
/INFORME-CORRECCION-v0.5.1.md

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
